policies['privacy-policy'].sections.push(['Keeping your enquiry relevant','Only share the details needed for your request. Product names, measurements and a destination country are usually enough to begin. A full delivery address is requested only when needed for an agreed order.'],['Keeping records accurate','If your email address or enquiry details change, send a correction using the contact form. Include enough context to identify your earlier message without sending unnecessary sensitive information.'],['Service providers and safeguards','The operating business is responsible for selecting hosting and email providers, restricting access to enquiry records and documenting any cross-border processing arrangements that apply.'],['Policy changes','This page may be updated when the website features, enquiry process or operating arrangements change. Any significant new processing purpose should be explained before information is collected for it.']);
policies['terms-conditions'].sections.push(['Dimensions and natural variation','Measurements should be checked against the confirmed finished-item specification. Woven textures, dye batches, screens and room lighting can affect the appearance of colour and surface detail. Ask for clarification before agreeing to an order.'],['Care and use','Use the care instructions provided for the finished item. General guides on this website are a starting point and cannot replace a product-specific label or written supplier instruction.'],['Changes to a request','Contact us promptly if you wish to amend an enquiry or a proposed order. Changes to dimensions, materials, quantities or delivery requirements may affect the final proposal and must be confirmed in writing.'],['Website availability','Content and features may be updated or temporarily unavailable. If a page or contact form is not working, no order or enquiry should be assumed accepted without an explicit confirmation.']);
policies['cookies'].sections.push(['Local storage and cookies','Local storage remains in the browser rather than being automatically included in every HTTP request. Session cookies are sent to the same website for the purpose of maintaining the secure form session.'],['Your browser controls','Most browsers let you inspect and delete individual website data. Deleting the preference will show the notice again; deleting the contact session requires a fresh security token before submission.'],['External links','Links to other websites open services with their own storage and privacy practices. This website does not control those services. Review their information if you choose to visit them.']);
policies['shipping-returns'].sections.push(['Information to include','Mention the collection, colour direction, quantity and dimensions you are considering. Include a destination country so relevant delivery options can be discussed.'],['Before dispatch','The final written confirmation should identify the items, delivery address, agreed charges and expected dispatch arrangements. Ask about any packaging or handling requirements for delicate or bulky items.'],['Return preparation','Before sending an item back, request the correct return address and instructions. Keep any order reference and proof of dispatch. Do not assume a general contact address is a return destination.'],['Care while assessing an item','Retain labels and packaging while checking the item. Inspect the dimensions, colour and condition before washing or altering it, and raise any concern promptly so the circumstances can be reviewed.']);

